/T (The convergence of Aadhaar, e-KYC, and the UPI, collectively known as the core of India Stack has revolutionized digital adoption in India by creating a zero-friction, paperless, and presence-less onboarding funnel. This infrastructure has enabled over 100 million users to join the digital financial ecosystem by reducing the cost of customer acquisition from over $23 to nearly $0.15. The system enables users to complete identity verification and bank-linked account activation in minutes, with over 284 crore Aadhaar authentication transactions recorded in January 2025 alone. )
