/T (Reasons- Low Fear of Loss: Young investors have fewer financial obligations and longer recovery horizons, reducing loss aversion and increasing risk-taking behavior. App-Native Tech Comfort: High technological familiarity encourages experimental trading, including engagement with complex and high-risk assets. Wealth Gap Pressure: Rising inflation and housing costs make traditional savings appear inadequate, pushing youth toward high-return investment options. Gamification Effect: Game-like features such as leaderboards and instant feedback heighten excitement and promote emotionally driven, riskier trades. Overconfidence Bias: Simplified, user-friendly platforms create a false sense of safety, leading to overconfidence despite limited financial knowledge. Low Sunk-Cost Sensitivity: Small initial investments reduce perceived loss, encouraging speculative and high-risk investment decisions.)
/E (Reasons- Low Fear of Loss: Young investors have fewer financial obligations and longer recovery horizons, reducing loss aversion and increasing risk-taking behavior. App-Native Tech Comfort: High technological familiarity encourages experimental trading, including engagement with complex and high-risk assets. Wealth Gap Pressure: Rising inflation and housing costs make traditional savings appear inadequate, pushing youth toward high-return investment options. Gamification Effect: Game-like features such as leaderboards and instant feedback heighten excitement and promote emotionally driven, riskier trades. Overconfidence Bias: Simplified, user-friendly platforms create a false sense of safety, leading to overconfidence despite limited financial knowledge. Low Sunk-Cost Sensitivity: Small initial investments reduce perceived loss, encouraging speculative and high-risk investment decisions.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [12]
>>
