379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1364 0 R
/E (None of this implies malice or illegality. Brokers operate within regulatory frameworks, disclose charges in fine print, and remain compliant. The illusion persists not because of deception, but because of asymmetric attention. Retail traders focus on what is removed \(brokerage\) rather than what is introduced or amplified elsewhere. The industry celebrates lower headline costs while quietly normalising a new fee architecture that is harder to see, harder to calculate, and harder to challenge.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1365 0 R
/E (Understanding this does not mean rejecting modern platforms or returning to legacy models. It means approaching the market with clarity rather than slogans. Because in a system that claims to be free, the most expensive thing a trader can buy is ignorance of the true cost.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
