/S /H2
/P 161 0 R
/T (Inference The results show that risk-awareness guardrails are most supported by users. The most preferred feature is pre-trade risk warnings with a required exit plan \(50%\), followed closely by daily or pre-trade loss limits \(47.1%\) and confirmation delays for high-risk orders \(41.2%\), indicating users favor preventive controls before placing risky trades.)
/E (Inference The results show that risk-awareness guardrails are most supported by users. The most preferred feature is pre-trade risk warnings with a required exit plan \(50%\), followed closely by daily or pre-trade loss limits \(47.1%\) and confirmation delays for high-risk orders \(41.2%\), indicating users favor preventive controls before placing risky trades.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [11]
