/Title (Inference The results show that cost relative to value is the most significant concern, with 32.4% of respondents indicating that trading platforms feel expensive for the services provided. Additionally, 26.5% find platforms difficult to learn or navigate, while 20.6% report that slow trading processes or frequent crashes disrupt their trading activities. These findings suggest that both financial costs and usability challenges significantly contribute to user frustration on trading platforms.)
